    <h1>The Strategic Navigator: <em>Navigator</em> Strengths and Careers</h1>
    <p class="dek">If you instinctively see the whole board, set the order of play, and decide what to leave out, Navigator is likely one of your top strengths. Here is what it is, the careers that reward it, how it holds up against AI, and the blind spot that stalls strong strategists.</p>
